<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-WMC links nickel price drop to steel.</title>
<headline>RTRS-WMC links nickel price drop to steel.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Resources group WMC Ltd said on Friday the recent decline in nickel prices reflected reduced demand for stainless steel and an accumulation of stainless steel stocks.</p>
</text>
